97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simulateRepeatedGame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(titForTat, alwaysDefect, prisonersDilemma, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`TFT vs 始终背叛: 合作率=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cooperationRate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重复博弈的洞察在技术行业的应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>开源社区</strong>：长期重复交互促进了合作文化，声誉机制约束了搭便车行为</li>\n<li><strong>供应商关系</strong>：与云服务商的长期合作关系比频繁切换更有利</li>\n<li><strong>技术面试</strong>：面试是一次性博弈，但行业圈子小，声誉在长期博弈中传播</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"信息不对称与信号博弈\">信息不对称与信号博弈</h2><p>现实中的博弈往往存在信息不对称——一方拥有另一方不知道的信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信息问题</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>技术案例</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逆向选择</td>\n<td>交易前的信息不对称</td>\n<td>招聘时无法准确评估候选人能力</td>\n<td>技术面试、试用期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>道德风险</td>\n<td>交易后的行为不可观察</td>\n<td>远程员工偷懒</td>\n<td>产出导向考核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号发送</td>\n<td>有信息方主动传递信号</td>\n<td>开源项目展示技术能力</td>\n<td>GitHub 开源贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号甄别</td>\n<td>无信息方设计筛选机制</td>\n<td>企业通过编程测试筛选候选人</td>\n<td>算法题、系统设计面试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>信号理论</strong>在程序员职业中尤其重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Signal {&#10;  type: string;&#10;  cost: number;&#10;  credibility: &#39;high&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;low&#39;;&#10;  effectiveness: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const evaluateCareerSignals = (): Signal[] =&gt; [&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;名校学历&#39;,&#10;    cost: 4,&#10;    credibility: &#39;high&#39;,&#10;    effectiveness: 0.7,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;大厂工作经历&#39;,&#10;    cost: 3,&#10;    credibility: &#39;high&#39;,&#10;    effectiveness: 0.8,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;开源项目（高星）&#39;,&#10;    cost: 2,&#10;    credibility: &#39;high&#39;,&#10;    effectiveness: 0.9,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;技术博客&#39;,&#10;    cost: 1,&#10;    credibility: &#39;medium&#39;,&#10;    effectiveness: 0.5,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;算法竞赛奖项&#39;,&#10;    cost: 3,&#10;    credibility: &#39;high&#39;,&#10;    effectiveness: 0.6,&#10;  },&#10;];&#10;&#10;const signals = evaluateCareerSignals();&#10;const sorted = [...signals].sort((a, b) =&gt; b.effectiveness / b.cost - a.effectiveness / a.cost);&#10;sorted.forEach((s) =&gt; {&#10;  const roi = (s.effectiveness / s.cost).toFixed(2);&#10;  console.log(`${s.type}: 效果=${s.effectiveness}, 成本=${s.cost}, ROI=${roi}`);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></